   "t": "'Hello, Colette?' Andrea answers her ringing phone away from the loud music.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "colette",
   "t": "Je suis désolée pour hier soir.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I am sorry about last night.' Colette opens with a sincere and tender apology.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "colette",
   "t": "J'ai vraiment dépassé les bornes.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I really crossed the line.' Colette regrets putting unfair pressure on Andrea.",
   "gap": 0.4
