   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'No, it is nothing.' Andrea gently reassures her partner.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "colette",
   "t": "Ce n'est pas facile pour toi.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'It is not easy for you.' Colette shows deep empathy for Andrea's inner turmoil.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "colette",
   "t": "Tu vis quelque chose d'incroyable.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You are living through something incredible.' Colette recognizes the magnitude of the pregnancy.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "colette",
   "t": "Je voulais te dire que je suis là.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I wanted to tell you that I am here.' Colette promises steadfast emotional support.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "colette",
   "t": "Je veux le vivre avec toi.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I want to experience it with you.' Colette decides to embrace the journey together.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "colette",
   "t": "Parce que je t'aime, Andréa.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Because I love you, Andrea.' Colette makes a vulnerable and heartfelt declaration of love.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Moi aussi je t'aime, Colette.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
